From: Peter Tian <peter.tian@nxp.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jan 2025 04:54:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [EasyEVSE] UART: Reduce characters received before BUS
 idle

Signed-off-by: Peter Tian <peter.tian@nxp.com>
---
 drivers/tty/serial/fsl_lpuart.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/tty/serial/fsl_lpuart.c b/drivers/tty/serial/fsl_lpuart.c
index 90f47c730cd8..b9b8ccc6ef31 100644
--- a/drivers/tty/serial/fsl_lpuart.c
+++ b/drivers/tty/serial/fsl_lpuart.c
@@ -238,7 +238,7 @@
 #define GLOBAL_RST_MAX_US	40
 
 #define UARTFIFO_RXIDEN_RDRF	0x3
-#define UARTCTRL_IDLECFG	0x7
+#define UARTCTRL_IDLECFG	0x3
 
 /* Rx DMA timeout in ms, which is used to calculate Rx ring buffer size */
 #define DMA_RX_TIMEOUT		(10)
